{"type":"assistant","uuid":"4c8296bf-51c6-431d-ae46-79faa76b7f3b","session_id":"6e908e0e-2ee7-431d-b303-30aaa260a97f","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"4c8296bf-51c6-431d-ae46-79faa76b7f3b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## Bug Fix Summary\n\n### Root Cause\n\nThe crash occurred in **`TotpProgressBar.java`** at the `refresh()` method when a TOTP entry's period value exceeded the `ProgressBar`'s `maxProgress` value (default: 100).\n\n**Stack trace of the crash:**\n\n1. User creates a manual entry with period = `9999` seconds\n2. `EditEntryActivity.parseEntry()` → `TotpInfo.setPeriod(9999)` passes validation\n3. `EntryHolder.setShowProgress()` → `_progressBar.setPeriod(9999)` → `startRefreshLoop()` → `refresh()`\n4. In `TotpProgressBar.refresh()`:\n   ```java\n   int maxProgress = getMax();       // = 100 (default ProgressBar max)\n   int animPart = maxProgress / _period;  // = 100 / 9999 = 0 (integer division!)\n   int animEnd = (currentProgress / animPart) * animPart;  // / by zero → CRASH!\n   ```\n\n### Fix\n\nAdded a clamping variable `effectivePeriod` that ensures the divisor in the animation calculation never results in zero:\n\n```java\n// clamp period to maxProgress to avoid integer division resulting in zero\nint effectivePeriod = Math.min(_period, maxProgress);\nint animPart = maxProgress / effectivePeriod;\n```\n\nWhen `_period = 9999` and `maxProgress = 100`:\n- **Before:** `animPart = 100 / 9999 = 0` → **divide by zero crash**\n- **After:** `effectivePeriod = min(9999, 100) = 100` → `animPart = 100 / 100 = 1` → safe\n\n### Patch\n\nThe patch is saved at: `fix.patch`\n\n### Note on Build\n\nThe project build cannot complete due to network restrictions (jcenter.bintray.com and dl.google.com are unreachable from this environment). The Java syntax of the fix is correct — only one line was changed, replacing `_period` with `Math.min(_period, maxProgress)` in a safe arithmetic context."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":50877,"output_tokens":503,"cache_read_input_tokens":50304,"total_tokens":51380}}}
